 # Coupled pilot
 
-Run the pilot using scripts/run_coupled_pilot.py. Case selection needs documenting.
+Run the pilot using `scripts/run_coupled_pilot.py`. To select specific cases, repeat
+`--case`; for example:
+
+```sh
+python3 scripts/run_coupled_pilot.py --case alpha --case gamma
+```
+
+Repeated IDs are deduplicated. Selected cases run once each in their original
+suite order, not flag order. Unknown IDs fail before output is created or any
+case executes. Without `--case`, the no-filter default runs all cases. The
+existing no-overwrite guard and independent oracles are preserved.
